      <title>Indonesia Halts Flights as Active Volcano Risks More Disruptions</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-06/indonesia-halts-jakarta-lampung-flights-on-volcanic-eruptions</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">445069318448c4b3eb383e08</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:44:33 +0000</pubDate>
